WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.300
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:30.720 --> 01:33.590
I saw it. Sakie and Tsuzuki were...

01:33.790 --> 01:36.060
Really? In the gym storage room?

01:36.130 --> 01:38.500
Every day. They're doing it every day.

01:38.570 --> 01:40.190
So disgusting!

01:41.470 --> 01:43.630
Mr. Tsuzuki, I can't...

01:44.540 --> 01:46.510
I can't deal with this anymore.

01:46.910 --> 01:48.570
I don't want to be alive.

01:54.920 --> 01:56.140
This is horrible...

02:00.290 --> 02:01.250
Damn it!

02:12.430 --> 02:14.060
Hey! Get it together!

02:14.130 --> 02:15.030
Hey!

02:15.100 --> 02:18.660
Brother, she is
Miss Sakie Amamoto...

02:21.470 --> 02:22.640
<i>Conciliation</i>

02:22.640 --> 02:26.540
<i>Conciliation
Episode 20</i>

02:27.810 --> 02:30.110
Douka Academy,
the six names have been revealed.

02:30.180 --> 02:31.410
Sakie Amamoto...

02:31.480 --> 02:32.750
Mihoko Fujisaki...

02:32.820 --> 02:33.980
Miwa Tsutsui...

02:34.050 --> 02:35.350
Kazumi Takashima...

02:35.420 --> 02:36.550
Rie Minakami...

02:36.620 --> 02:37.920
Noriko Minami...

02:38.060 --> 02:39.890
Out of those six,
five of them are dead.

02:39.960 --> 02:43.790
The last person inhaled a large
amount of water and is unconscious.

02:43.930 --> 02:46.590
You, hurry and bring her
to the medical treatment room!

02:46.670 --> 02:47.560
Yes, sir!

02:51.300 --> 02:53.700
Doctor, please come!
She's regained consciousness.

02:53.970 --> 02:55.200
Group suicide.

02:55.280 --> 02:58.210
Right. Five female students
drowned themselves in a pool.

02:58.650 --> 02:59.410
Did you say souvenir?

02:59.480 --> 03:01.450
No, idiot! I said they drowned!

03:03.420 --> 03:05.880
Well, she was a really different girl.

03:06.320 --> 03:07.980
What do you mean by different?

03:08.090 --> 03:11.650
Well, she didn't fit in
with the students...

03:11.730 --> 03:14.290
Or more like they hated her...

03:14.360 --> 03:16.020
A girl that's hated by others...

03:16.100 --> 03:19.220
...commits suicide hand in hand
with five other students?

03:19.500 --> 03:21.660
That horrible thing
happened to Mr. Tsuzuki...

03:21.740 --> 03:23.760
...and on the same day this incident...

03:24.470 --> 03:26.100
I don't get it at all.

03:26.610 --> 03:28.100
I can't even guess.

03:28.840 --> 03:32.900
So, about the situation when
you found the five of them...

03:32.980 --> 03:33.810
Sis!

03:33.880 --> 03:34.780
Sakie!

03:48.230 --> 03:49.160
Sis...

03:52.500 --> 03:53.900
I'm glad...

03:54.170 --> 03:56.070
I'm glad you're all right...

03:56.670 --> 03:59.430
You are the parents of
Miss Sakie Amamoto, right?

04:01.340 --> 04:04.000
Sis, rest well.

04:04.310 --> 04:07.300
These guys found her first.

04:07.380 --> 04:11.940
They jumped into the pool
and saved your daughter.

04:12.790 --> 04:14.520
Thank you for that...

04:14.890 --> 04:16.880
I don't know how to thank you...

04:17.090 --> 04:18.560
Sakie!

04:18.690 --> 04:19.920
Where are you!

04:21.390 --> 04:22.620
Sakie!

04:24.030 --> 04:26.560
W-What is it, everyone!

04:29.700 --> 04:32.140
Sakie killed my daughter, right?

04:32.210 --> 04:35.370
There is no way my
daughter would commit suicide!

04:35.440 --> 04:37.710
How could you kill her! It's horrible!

04:42.920 --> 04:44.350
Are you okay, Naoya?

04:47.020 --> 04:48.150
Someone is...

04:48.220 --> 04:49.710
Someone is laughing.

05:02.340 --> 05:04.600
Hey, cut it out!

05:14.280 --> 05:15.080
Stop it!

05:20.050 --> 05:21.610
B-Brother!

05:23.520 --> 05:26.420
He had a knife and
all of a sudden came at me.

05:26.630 --> 05:29.150
Just now, my body...

05:29.460 --> 05:31.090
You saw, right?

05:36.670 --> 05:38.660
That guy isn't there.

05:39.370 --> 05:41.530
I beg you, Tomomi...

05:42.080 --> 05:43.740
Bring me to the house...

05:44.440 --> 05:47.410
Bring me to our home.
I have to go back to my room.

05:47.510 --> 05:48.740
Please...

05:52.020 --> 05:53.010
Brother...

05:56.320 --> 05:58.690
You saw there was a guy
standing in the hallway, right?

05:58.760 --> 05:59.620
Yeah...

06:00.190 --> 06:02.130
The one that was laughing was him.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.990
That guy came into my heart...

06:06.070 --> 06:08.160
...and figured out my weakness.

06:13.640 --> 06:16.970
I was scared to use
my power so much, but...

06:17.040 --> 06:20.310
...when I thought you were going
to be attacked, I all of a sudden...

06:22.450 --> 06:23.970
I promised...

06:24.480 --> 06:28.820
Even if it becomes a battle,
I will never kill anyone again.

06:29.260 --> 06:31.750
Even if Ark comes
and does something...

06:32.990 --> 06:34.080
Brother...

06:35.430 --> 06:36.520
Naoya...

06:37.100 --> 06:39.290
There is a future to your powers.

06:39.670 --> 06:42.000
A power that will
most likely be useful.

06:42.340 --> 06:44.600
But my powers are different.

06:44.840 --> 06:46.240
It's the power of destruction.

06:46.870 --> 06:49.270
There is definitely
a meaning to praying.

06:49.540 --> 06:52.340
But I can't do anything
with just my powers.

06:52.650 --> 06:54.810
I can only feel things.

06:56.550 --> 06:59.680
Just feeling is like having no power.

07:02.190 --> 07:05.820
What kind of power
does Miss Sakie have?

07:06.460 --> 07:09.550
If it goes to Ark's hands,
it's going to be a disaster.

07:10.160 --> 07:11.560
This is strange.

07:11.760 --> 07:15.460
If they wanted her,
they should have taken her already.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.670
Yeah.

07:22.280 --> 07:23.870
What is their intention?

07:24.910 --> 07:29.140
She was driven to the
corner and was all alone.

07:29.750 --> 07:32.310
She was wandering
around the thick fog.

08:34.250 --> 08:35.540
You are...

08:39.520 --> 08:40.820
Miss Sakie...

08:41.790 --> 08:44.920
You are the one that saved me.

08:45.730 --> 08:47.350
Why did such a thing happen?

08:48.160 --> 08:49.360
Because I...

08:49.730 --> 08:50.720
What?

08:51.700 --> 08:53.360
I killed them...

08:54.400 --> 08:55.590
...those girls...

08:55.970 --> 08:57.090
I did...

08:57.970 --> 08:59.100
What do you mean?

09:00.440 --> 09:04.210
Because I thought I wanted to die.

09:05.680 --> 09:07.270
It's my fault.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.410
Wow, balloons!

09:46.650 --> 09:47.240
Here.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.410
Thank you!

09:48.490 --> 09:49.550
Me too!

09:49.620 --> 09:49.990
There you go.

09:49.990 --> 09:50.920
There you go.
I want that color!

10:00.670 --> 10:02.600
I want a red one too!

10:02.670 --> 10:03.690
The red one!

10:03.770 --> 10:04.760
I want red!

10:04.870 --> 10:06.200
Me too!

10:06.270 --> 10:08.070
I want red too!

10:08.140 --> 10:09.400
Make it a red one!

10:09.480 --> 10:11.000
Red!

10:28.560 --> 10:29.890
I hate Sakie!

10:29.960 --> 10:31.830
She's so creepy
when we're together!

10:31.900 --> 10:34.090
I don't want to be in
the same class as her.

10:35.640 --> 10:40.040
If you are with Sakie, Sakie's
depressing feeling just takes over.

10:40.110 --> 10:41.600
Maybe something possesses her?

10:41.670 --> 10:43.140
So creepy...

10:43.610 --> 10:45.040
I want to die.

10:45.550 --> 10:47.170
I just want to die.

10:47.580 --> 10:49.010
I can't take it anymore.

10:49.250 --> 10:51.220
I have to kill my emotions.

10:51.680 --> 10:53.880
I can't bring my emotions out.

10:54.390 --> 10:56.950
I have to stay still like a shellfish.

10:57.420 --> 10:59.450
Pile in my emotions...

11:01.390 --> 11:02.520
Sakie...

11:02.860 --> 11:04.630
It's okay now.

11:04.700 --> 11:06.820
I'll protect you.

11:07.330 --> 11:09.730
There won't be
things like that anymore.

11:11.140 --> 11:12.800
Mr. Tsuzuki...

11:16.740 --> 11:18.900
You make the face of a weakling...

11:19.080 --> 11:22.840
What kind of tactics did you use
to seduce your homeroom teacher?

11:23.050 --> 11:23.810
Well?

11:24.080 --> 11:25.520
You whore!

11:26.550 --> 11:28.280
You piss me off!

11:40.970 --> 11:42.940
No!

11:46.670 --> 11:47.640
Naoya!

11:49.740 --> 11:50.770
Are you okay?

11:51.040 --> 11:52.510
Get it together, Naoya!

11:59.520 --> 12:02.580
I found out Miss Sakie's powers.

12:03.790 --> 12:06.690
Her emotions are
transmitted to others.

12:06.960 --> 12:09.620
The influence of her
heart is extremely strong.

12:10.330 --> 12:12.800
Emotions are transmitted?

12:13.600 --> 12:17.130
It's most likely a power that's
the evolved form of telepathy.

12:17.640 --> 12:22.970
That power is too strong, so she's
always tried so hard to kill her emotions.

12:24.810 --> 12:28.580
Mr. Tsuzuki was trying
to save Miss Sakie.

12:28.880 --> 12:32.650
He knew it was dangerous,
but he was trying to see us.

12:46.370 --> 12:49.770
<i>Prefecture General Hospital</i>

12:59.980 --> 13:01.070
Over here.

13:09.690 --> 13:11.550
Man you seriously surprised me!

13:11.620 --> 13:12.820
What is it all of a sudden?

13:12.890 --> 13:15.190
I was waiting for the train on
the concourse the other day.

13:15.260 --> 13:16.230
A train?

13:16.300 --> 13:20.360
Then a train filled with all
different kinds of seaweed came by.

13:21.000 --> 13:21.830
What is with that?

13:21.900 --> 13:24.270
This was the real out of service train!

13:24.340 --> 13:25.740
That's so stupid!

13:35.580 --> 13:37.340
Hey, w-what is it?

13:37.420 --> 13:38.510
Don't do it!

13:38.580 --> 13:41.520
Don't. It's not someone
you can fight against.

13:41.650 --> 13:43.210
You will lose.

13:43.290 --> 13:45.220
He will break you.

13:45.490 --> 13:47.650
You will be hurt and die like a dog.

13:47.730 --> 13:48.990
Don't fight.

13:49.060 --> 13:50.390
Don't fight with Mikumo.

13:50.830 --> 13:51.730
Run!

14:01.970 --> 14:03.070
Hey, stop it!

14:03.310 --> 14:04.570
Hey, someone!

14:04.680 --> 14:05.770
Someone come here!

14:06.250 --> 14:07.270
Brother...

14:12.650 --> 14:17.520
Why did Akiko Okuhara send
that guy into Miss Sakie's school?

14:17.920 --> 14:19.220
What do you mean?

14:19.430 --> 14:22.290
Do you think she couldn't
predict Mr. Tsuzuki's moves?

14:22.660 --> 14:26.760
Like how he betrayed the company
and tried to protect Miss Sakie.

14:27.470 --> 14:29.200
Futami is related to this too.

14:29.440 --> 14:30.770
You and I also.

14:31.400 --> 14:35.860
Meaning there was some
uncertain data in Okuhara's predictions.

14:42.650 --> 14:44.210
Brother, what's the matter?

14:44.580 --> 14:45.410
Look!

14:45.480 --> 14:46.920
I-Inside the car!

14:47.020 --> 14:47.990
What?

14:51.590 --> 14:53.680
There's nothing inside...

14:53.760 --> 14:56.020
You can't see that thing?

14:58.000 --> 14:59.360
Nothing really...

15:02.840 --> 15:06.740
Stop acting like a good person
even though you're a murderer!

15:06.840 --> 15:09.170
You're a murderer!

15:09.240 --> 15:11.710
A devil! You're a devil!

15:11.940 --> 15:12.930
Damn it!

15:13.550 --> 15:14.310
Come out!

15:15.310 --> 15:15.940
Brother!

15:24.760 --> 15:26.660
You murderer!

15:26.930 --> 15:28.390
Murderer!

15:32.570 --> 15:33.590
Where'd it go!

15:33.900 --> 15:34.890
Brother!

15:34.970 --> 15:36.330
What's wrong!

15:36.400 --> 15:37.770
I was killed!

15:38.600 --> 15:40.470
You murdered us!

15:40.840 --> 15:43.100
We were killed with your powers!

15:43.180 --> 15:44.510
It's your fault!

15:44.640 --> 15:46.040
It's the power of destruction!

15:46.110 --> 15:47.440
Murderer!

15:47.510 --> 15:49.500
I still wanted to live.

15:49.580 --> 15:52.610
You were the one that ended my life!

15:52.990 --> 15:53.970
Shut up!

15:54.320 --> 15:55.550
Be quiet! Be quiet!

15:55.620 --> 15:57.350
Brother, what's going on!

15:57.490 --> 15:59.520
It hurts! I'm suffering!

15:59.590 --> 16:00.960
Help me!

16:01.030 --> 16:02.020
You're a devil!

16:02.090 --> 16:03.360
Devil!

16:03.430 --> 16:06.190
Give me back my life!

16:08.070 --> 16:09.860
It's all your fault!

16:23.080 --> 16:25.070
Brother! Get it together!

16:45.340 --> 16:46.200
Damn it!

16:46.270 --> 16:48.000
Brother, calm down!

16:57.750 --> 16:59.550
It's mind control.

16:59.620 --> 17:01.140
Brother, calm down.

17:09.160 --> 17:10.290
Is it you?

17:25.140 --> 17:26.130
Stop it!

17:26.510 --> 17:27.710
Brother, no!

17:27.780 --> 17:29.150
Don't use your powers!

17:35.820 --> 17:36.650
Watch out!

17:54.440 --> 17:55.530
What's the matter!

17:56.040 --> 17:57.010
Is it a patient?

17:57.510 --> 17:59.480
No, he's not.

18:00.010 --> 18:01.600
It's fine now.

18:01.680 --> 18:02.700
Sorry about that.

18:04.350 --> 18:05.250
Damn it!

18:06.990 --> 18:08.850
What are you trying to do!

18:09.790 --> 18:11.020
Answer!

18:11.190 --> 18:13.720
I'm asking what are you trying to do!

18:18.000 --> 18:19.060
Um...

18:19.570 --> 18:22.360
I'm sorry. It's nothing.

18:22.430 --> 18:23.960
I'm very sorry!

18:28.210 --> 18:30.800
Brother, I beg you, calm down.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.080
Yeah...

18:32.310 --> 18:33.340
I'm sorry.

18:34.050 --> 18:35.510
But I'm glad.

18:35.780 --> 18:38.310
I'm glad you didn't use your powers.

18:41.320 --> 18:42.410
Brother...

18:43.160 --> 18:45.750
I don't know what's going on.

18:45.990 --> 18:47.580
It's okay now.

18:51.130 --> 18:53.060
Tsuzuki warned you.

18:53.130 --> 18:56.570
You should think hard about
the words Tsuzuki told you!

18:57.840 --> 19:00.530
Were you able to hear his voice too?

19:00.840 --> 19:02.600
Yeah, I heard it.

19:02.980 --> 19:05.500
He's most likely
watching us from somewhere.

19:16.820 --> 19:17.810
There he is!

19:17.890 --> 19:20.420
Naoya, the top floor
of the building in front of us!

19:25.530 --> 19:26.690
That's him!

19:26.800 --> 19:28.790
Brother, calm down.

19:28.970 --> 19:30.330
Don't get flustered.

19:30.740 --> 19:33.600
He's good at going
into people's hearts.

19:33.670 --> 19:35.300
I know, let's go!

19:49.320 --> 19:50.750
Welcome!

19:56.860 --> 19:58.120
Please come this way.

20:41.770 --> 20:43.300
Welcome!

20:47.780 --> 20:49.810
<i>Reception office</i>

20:49.880 --> 20:51.180
I have brought them.

20:55.890 --> 20:57.950
Welcome, both of you.

20:59.260 --> 21:00.320
I'm Mikumo.

21:01.230 --> 21:03.190
Well, don't be shy.

21:03.260 --> 21:04.750
This is my office.

21:05.230 --> 21:08.560
But only since about 10 minutes ago.

21:11.370 --> 21:12.930
I wanted to meet you.

21:13.010 --> 21:15.700
To see what kind of guys you were.

21:16.440 --> 21:19.740
Now I understand the reason why the
president hasn't eliminated you guys.

21:20.050 --> 21:21.070
The reason?

21:21.150 --> 21:22.110
Yeah.

21:22.750 --> 21:24.150
Could we hear it?

21:25.550 --> 21:27.380
Well, don't rush.

21:28.250 --> 21:29.950
Naoto Kirihara...

21:30.520 --> 21:33.220
Now you know
what my power is, right?

21:33.390 --> 21:35.520
You can't win against me.

21:36.360 --> 21:39.730
But I will give you
a chance just this once.

21:40.300 --> 21:41.390
A chance?

21:42.170 --> 21:43.100
Yeah.

21:52.010 --> 21:53.380
What are you trying to do?

21:55.380 --> 21:59.820
Well, if you use a little bit
of power, you can kill me.

22:00.020 --> 22:01.420
Just a little bit.

22:01.920 --> 22:03.820
You just need to push my hand.

22:04.860 --> 22:06.790
Isn't it something easy for you?

22:06.930 --> 22:08.020
You...

22:08.190 --> 22:09.290
Brother!

22:09.360 --> 22:11.800
Come on, do it.

22:17.540 --> 22:18.660
Come on...

22:31.250 --> 22:34.520
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.590 --> 22:37.180
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.260 --> 22:41.850
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.930 --> 22:45.160
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.230 --> 22:47.860
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.270
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.710 --> 23:03.980
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.050 --> 23:10.680
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.760 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.290 --> 23:18.860
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.930 --> 23:24.200
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.270 --> 23:29.730
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.810 --> 23:34.610
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:40.140
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.220 --> 23:45.490
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.560 --> 23:51.020
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.100 --> 23:58.200
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:02.470 --> 24:05.970
The cold echo of
the illusion of desire.

24:06.580 --> 24:10.810
That is what permeates
into the prelude of the end.

24:12.450 --> 24:15.350
The ridicule that clings on and
eats away at the consciousness.

24:15.750 --> 24:17.980
The soul colored in taboo...

24:18.660 --> 24:22.150
...drops their selves
to the eternity of silence.

24:23.330 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 21, "Funeral"</i>

24:26.100 --> 24:29.860
Where are we headed?
